        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[One OS User per Agent]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Give each long-lived agent its own OS user account and a templated init-system unit, so identity, supervision and privilege come from the host instead of from a per-agent container.]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/one-os-user-per-agent</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/one-os-user-per-agent</guid>
