        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Out-of-Process Provider-Boundary Replay]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Capture an agent run at the model-provider HTTP boundary from outside the process, then serve those bytes back so the agent re-executes its own logic with no provider call.]]></description>
