        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Skill Activation as a Precision/Recall Measurement]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Treat "did the right skill load?" as a classification problem with a labelled dataset and per-skill precision/recall, because skill selection is a routing decision that silently changes whenever any description in the catalog changes.]]></description>
