        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Tier Auto-Apply by Mechanical Impact]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[A system that reviews itself and applies its own findings, a self auditing agent, say, needs a line between "apply automatically" and "ask a human first." The tempting way to draw that line is from how confident or severe a finding sounds.]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/tier-auto-apply-by-mechanical-impact</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/tier-auto-apply-by-mechanical-impact</guid>
